device 1 close
pre-erase off
label case asis
set postscript ppi 800
frame coordinates 10 10 98 98 
char size 1
label size 3
tic mark label size 3
char fill on
char circle 
lines blank
skip 25
read pontius.dat y x
x1label Load
y1label Deflection
device 2 postscript
plot y x 
device 2 close
system mv dppl1f.dat initmd.ps
quit
